<title>SINGAPORE: Digital launches S$5.0 mln Asia helpdesk.</title>
<headline>Digital launches S$5.0 mln Asia helpdesk.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. computer company Digital Equipment said on Wednesday it had opened a helpdesk in Singapore for its customers in Asia.</p>
<p>Digital expects to spend more than Singapore $5.0 million on the facility by the end of 1997, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The centre would offer real-time support and advice in several languages to more than 10,000 regional users.</p>
<p>Digital's helpdesks in Asia, Europe and the United States were interlinked so that it could to provide 24-hour support to its customers every day of the year, it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
